abstract: >-
  A disciplined scaffold for formalizing the critical phenomena of
  gravitational collapse (Choptuik 1993; Reiterer-Trubowitz 2019) in
  Lean 4 with mathlib: the double-null arena, DSS echoing bookkeeping,
  the spectral core of the scaling law, a ZeroMQ bridge to a
  deterministic Python numerical service, a classified gap registry
  (G1-G6), a three-phase roadmap, and two research monographs (RU/EN,
  DOCX/PDF).
